#: Game.Levels.QuantifierWorld
msgid "# **Predicates & Quantifiers**\n"
"A **predicate** is a variable proposition where the variable comes from some universe of discourse. In Lean, we have:\n"
"* §0 meaning that §1 is a proposition\n"
"* §2 meaning that §3 is a *predicate* that takes a variable §4 and spits out a proposition.\n"
